------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  200 surrogates per generator set, numpy default_rng(seed=2026), identical projection.
  THIS IS THE CONTROL THAT MATTERS: combining irregular samples can manufacture peaks.
  If the real value is not beyond the surrogate 95th percentile the detection is not
  established.

